sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Admin/User
    participant UI as Chess Game UI
    participant Controller as Apex Controller
    participant Trigger as Chess Game Trigger
    participant Handler as Trigger Handler
    participant DB as Database
    participant Viewer as Chess Viewer Component

    Admin->>UI: Create/Update Chess Game
    UI->>Controller: Save Game Record
    Controller->>DB: Insert/Update Game
    DB-->>Controller: Game Saved
    
    alt Game Status = "Completed"
        Trigger->>Handler: After Insert/Update
        Handler->>DB: Query Players & Game
        DB-->>Handler: Player & Game Data
        
        Handler->>Handler: Calculate Expected Scores
        Handler->>Handler: Determine Actual Scores
        Handler->>Handler: Calculate New ELO Ratings
        
        Handler->>DB: Update Player ELO Ratings
        Handler->>DB: Update Player Statistics
        Handler->>DB: Update Game with ELO Info
        Handler->>DB: Create Player Rank Snapshot
        
        Handler->>Handler: Calculate Rank Positions
        Handler->>DB: Update Rank Positions
        
        DB-->>Handler: All Updates Complete
    end
    
    Controller-->>UI: Game Saved Successfully
    UI-->>Admin: Confirmation
    
    Admin->>Viewer: View Game on Chess Board
    Viewer->>Controller: Get Game Data
    Controller->>DB: Query Game & Moves
    DB-->>Controller: Game Data
    Controller-->>Viewer: Game Data
    
    Viewer->>Viewer: Parse FEN Notation
    Viewer->>Viewer: Render Chess Board
    Viewer->>Viewer: Display Player Info
    Viewer->>Viewer: Show Move History
    
    Viewer-->>Admin: Interactive Chess Board Display
    Admin->>Viewer: Navigate Move History
    Viewer->>Viewer: Update Board Position
    Viewer-->>Admin: Updated Position Display